      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Here's a draft review that balances honesty with Marcus's growth potential:\n\n\"Marcus, I appreciate your dedication to your work, and I value the effort you've been putting in as an engineer. However, I want to discuss some areas that need improvement. Your performance in Q3 was impacted by missing multiple sprint deadlines, which not only affects the team's efficiency but also limits our ability to deliver timely products. Additionally, there have been instances where your code requires significant revisions due to errors stemming from basic logic flaws. I believe it's crucial that we address these technical issues and encourage more robust problem-solving and technical ownership. To support you in this, I'd like to schedule a meeting to discuss some strategy and resources for improving code quality and communication. I'm committed to helping you grow in your role.\"\n\nThis review aims to provide constructive feedback while being honest about Marcus's struggles, avoiding overly positive language to ensure a useful and actionable review.",
